## SZ_MMN_HGF
Repository for Schizophrenia Mismatch Negativity Project Task Code

Based on task from Charlton et al., 2025 Imaging Neuroscience 
Paper: https://doi.org/10.1162/imag_a_00461
Charlton et al. shared their task code with us. 
JP modified task code to run on CCN lab EEG setup. 

Major modifications: 
--------------------
1. Changed EEG info to send triggers based on our setup
2. Changed response keys 
3. Changed instructions to English

How to run task: 
-------------------
1. Set up Audio in EEG Room B. 
Plug in Headphones and change sound output to 
'LG ULTRAGEAR -2'

Directory Info: 
-------------------
data ~ contains behavioral data from visual distractor task
design ~ contains design matrix, a mat file containing the 
helper_functions ~ contains helper f

